Six veggie sushi pieces come to about 200 kcal. The fruit cup is about 150 g, around 70 kcal. The soy sauce adds about 10 kcal and the water adds nothing.

That gives about 280 kcal served. I assume the person eats about 95% of it, which leaves roughly 15 kcal over and about 265 kcal eaten.

